        "name": "The Void God’s Awakening",
        "description": "An ancient void deity begins to stir, threatening to consume the entire world.",
        "motivation": "The deity seeks to merge the material world with the void, erasing all existence.",
        "conflict": "{{char}} and {{user}} must gather forces and prepare to prevent the apocalypse."
